## Pull request overview

This PR fixes CI build failures caused by TypeScript strict mode violations and a flaky async test. The changes address ~215 TypeScript errors (TS7006, TS2347, TS7053) across 10 files and resolve a race condition in SystemPages.test.tsx that caused intermittent test failures in CI.

**Changes:**
- Added explicit type annotations to callback parameters that were implicitly typed as `any` under strict mode
- Fixed untyped generic function calls in test mocks by casting `require('react')` to preserve type information
- Wrapped async test assertions in `waitFor()` blocks to eliminate race conditions

### Reviewed changes

Copilot reviewed 13 out of 13 changed files in this pull request and generated 16 comments.

