| apps/console/src/__tests__/view-config-schema.test.tsx | Added `: any` type annotations to array callback parameters in test assertions |
| apps/console/src/__tests__/ViewConfigPanel.test.tsx | Cast `require('react')` to preserve generics and typed `collapsed` state as `Record<string, boolean>` |
| apps/console/src/__tests__/SystemPages.test.tsx | Wrapped all `screen.getByText()` assertions in `waitFor()` blocks to fix race conditions |
| apps/console/src/App.tsx | Added `: any` type annotations to useGlobalUndo callbacks, ActionRunner handler, and onConnectionStateChange |
| ROADMAP.md | Updated test count from 6,500+ to 6,700+ |
